	(text "Optional 2nd antenna for BLE (dual-antenna mode), all DNP by default.\nDefault = shared antenna: R12 0R fitted, BLE combined onto RF_MAIN.\nDual antenna: remove R12, fit R24 0R + J7 (C22/C23 = match, tune), set antenna config in firmware.\nLayout: put R24 pad right at the BT_OUT/R12 node so the unused stub is ~0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
